{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は富士急ハイランドにて\n乃木坂46の「の」の公開録音イベントでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/4567827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブもしちゃったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリはこちら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Overture\n13日の金曜日\nシークレットグラフィティ―\n-MC-\nブランコ\n制服のマネキン\nおいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公開録音の方は\nWひな がMCしてくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/4567827/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中身は内緒です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送をお楽しみにね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ日焼けした気がするけど\nみんな平気だった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何はともあれ晴れて良かった～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駆けつけてくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/4567827/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田推しもいっぱい見つけられて\n嬉しかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/4567827/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/4567827/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の名古屋での個別のための。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/4567827/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたの節約術は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/4567827/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日この時間にこれやります！みたいな習慣とか癖ってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\nここ最近握手会ありすぎてネタがないとき\n答えを教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しむぜ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/4567827/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}